# RDX Governance

Three products in one app: marketing, Lead Desk, OS. Do not mix folders or tables.

## Before coding

1. Read `plot.md` — open only the files for this job
2. Read `context/progress-tracker.md`
3. New feature: require `specs/` status **Approved**, or write a Draft spec and stop
4. State: product · spec id or “maintenance” · files to touch · files to avoid

## Hard stops

- No mass deletes of living routes/API without founder OK
- No invented metrics (Copy Bank only)
- No new npm packages without founder OK
- No secrets in markdown

## New code

- `src/components/rdx/` · `src/content/rdx/`
- OS: `src/app/(os)/os/`, `src/components/os/`
- Plans: `specs/`

## End of session

`npm run build` && `npm run lint`. Update `context/progress-tracker.md`.
